## User

Sort a list with quicksort.

## Type

type
```haskell
quicksort :: Ord a => [a] -> [a]
```

## Term

```haskell
quicksort [] = []
quicksort (x:xs) = quicksort smaller ++ [x] ++ quicksort larger
  where
    smaller = [a | a <- xs, a <= x]
    larger = [a | a <- xs, a > x]
```

